@startuml Orchestrator_Context_BDD
title Block Definition Diagram - Orchestrator (External Context)

left to right direction

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor LightSteelBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 11
}

class "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator <<block>>
class "API-Gateway" as APIGateway <<block>>
class "PostgreSQL\n(bookproduction)" as Postgres <<block>>
class "Kafka Broker" as Kafka <<block>>

APIGateway --> Orchestrator : REST /api/v1/orchestrator/**
Orchestrator --> Postgres : persist orders
Orchestrator --> Kafka : publish orders.created

legend right
  --> : directed association
endlegend

@enduml